# convex-chat

Slack-style **learning demo** of idiomatic Convex. Read `AGENTS.md` for the short briefing. For a full product/architecture spec (including ports to another stack), read `docs/PRODUCT.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

- Vite + React + Convex Auth (password) + shadcn + `@convex-dev/presence`
- Frontend is local (`:5173`, Vite proxies `/api`). Backend is Convex Cloud by default (`npm run dev`); `npm run dev:local` uses a local CLI deployment. Do not commit `.env.local` or secrets
- One domain per `convex/*.ts` file. Index every lookup. Prefer queries/mutations over actions
- Selected channel is React state — do not add a router unless asked
- Preserve JSDoc on functions and component props
- Do not add DMs, file uploads, Clerk, Next.js, or password-reset email unless requested
